window.products.push({"id":470149,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, Silicone Ice Trays for Freezer with Lid and Bin, One Second Release All Ice Cubes,Comes with Press Plate,Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i3CknuHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2022 Brand New Upgrade Silicone Ice Cube Tray】Our ice cube tray are made of high quality food-grade silicone which is BPA free,safe and durable. Each tray can makes 24 nice-sized ice cubes,includes 2 trays (48 ice cubes total).Our ice tray with cover can also be washed in the dishwasher.Please noted that only the trays are dishwasher safe but the lids not. Please kindly note that the temperature does not exceed 140°F (60°C). 【Easy Release Ice Cube Tray】Our ice cube tray is easier to release the ice cubes than traditional plastic moulds,just press to release the ice in 1s.You can easily pour out all the ice cubes.Ice cube tray come with a removable lid to prevent ice from absorbing refrigerator odors or dust,so that the ice cubes can be kept fresh and odour-free.You can enjoy clear and clean ice cubes.Do not add more water than the water line to prevent ice cubes from sticking together. 【How to Use Ice Cube Trays 】Please wash these mold before you use it,fill the tray with water,you just need to fill water in trays to 90%-95%.Put the tray into the container,then cover the lid and put them into the freezer,and wait a few hours,take the frozen ice cube box from the fridge,then open the lid and buckle the soft glue upside down on the ice box and put on the cover with the pressing plate,just press down the cover,then ice cubes fall into the container easily. 【Ice Trays for Freezer with Lid】You can put water, drinks, fruits, ice cream, juice,cocktail,whisky,and what something you like,into the ice cube molds to make the ice cubes you want.Silicone ice cube tray set are great for home use, parties, restaurants, bars, etc .Ice storage container size: 28*13*9.5cm (L*W*H)/ 11*5.11*3.74in (L*W*H).Each ice tray size:27*11*2.5cm (L*W*H)/10.63*4.33*0.98 inch(L*W*H). Single tiny ice cube size 1 *1 in. 【Better Service】Our ice cube tray set contains 2 pcs trays,1 lid,1 press plate,1 storage container,and 1 ice scooper.All ice cube tray were carefully checked before shipping.Make sure these silicone ice cube tray are delivered to the customer in good condition.Customer shopping experience is very important.If you have any quality problems with ice cube tray,please feel free to contact us,we could offer full refund or exchange service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i3CknuHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pegilno","source_asin":"B0BB5Z7JJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB5Z7JJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB5Z7JJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
