window.products.push({"id":470210,"name":"zukakii Mattress Bags for Moving Queen Size with 8 Handles Extra-Thick Mattress Cover for Moving and Storage Reusable Mattress Storage Bag with Zipper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xjwpxE2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATTRESS BAG FOR MOVING: Shield your expensive mattress during transport or storage with zukakii durable Queen size mattress covers for moving and storage. Simply insert your large-sized mattress into the bag and zip it up for protection against rips, water damage, and dust. Enjoy peace of mind during renovation, moving, or long-term storage time. DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: zukakii mattress moving bag Queen size is crafted from incredibly durable 150G polyethylene tarpaulin, designed to withstand years of use and abuse without ripping, fading, or disintegrating, even with a 200+ pound mattress inside. The 3/4 zipper closure design makes it easy to insert or remove your mattress or box spring from the mattress bag for storage. 8 REINFORCED HANDLES: Our Queen mattress bag for moving features 8 upgraded sturdy handles, making it easy to transport your mattress upstairs, through narrow hallways, and into tight storage spaces. zukakii mattress cover is also designed to be dragged on the floor by one person, giving you full control when handling your mattress on you own. MATTRESS STORAGE: zukakii Queen mattress bags for storage offer a solution for long-term storage of your mattress. Simply zip it up to protect your mattress from dust, dirt, water, and stains. Please note that the zipper seam area is not completely waterproof, so make sure the 1/4 side of without the zipper touches the ground. REUSABLE PROTECTOR: zukakii Queen mattress bags for storage and moving are reusable, making them ideal for long-term storage and home relocation. Say goodbye to disposable protectors and save money while treating the environment well. If you are not satisfied with our mattress storage bag, please contact us for a full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xjwpxE2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"zukakii","source_asin":"B0BSDBLHFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSDBLHFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSDBLHFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
