window.products.push({"id":470409,"name":"CREOSA Bath Towels Set of 2pc Light Blue, 100% Long Staple Combed Cotton Ring Spun 600 GSM Absorbent Hotel Spa Quality Luxury Bath Sheets 35x70 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3b1QGpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABSORBENT OVERSIZED TOWELS SET: When you buy towels, you want a set that feels great on your skin and absorbs moisture. We get it, that’s why we’ve crafted luxe 600 GSM large bath towel that feel lush for a spa-like experience while making your skin happy. We achieve this by using only the finest combed cotton with low-twisting yarns so there’s more air & space in between the fibres to give you highly absorbent cotton towels. Our bundle of care is soft, caring, & comes in convenient packs too! 2 PC PREMIUM TOWEL SET Includes 2 Pc oversized bath towels set in size 35”X70”. These multipurpose, premium cotton bath towels are the same size as the premium beach towels you pack for your holidays. Yes, you can use them in your vacation as the large-sized cotton towels are designed to be used for beaches and your home. The towels include hanging loops for easy drying on hooks. 100% LONG STAPLE RING-SPUN COMBED COTTON: The ring-spun cotton fabric gives jumbo bath towels the premium hotel-like feel while making your towels noticeably finer, durable & offer a softer experience every day. The shorter threads are removed to only keep the longest fine yarns, and furthermore, the tight weave ensures the luxury bath sheets are highly absorbent, and resilient. The specially designed loop orientation gives you extra fluffiness. What’s more, our towels are made sustainably! MADE FOR YOU & OUR PLANET: We’re eco-friendly and our process is sustainable because we believe the future is green. We use zero harmful chemicals that make our towel set ideal for your family while being mindful of our environment and sustainable living. QUALITY YOU CAN TRUST Each piece is checked before the package reaches you. We’re BSCI compliant and OEKO-TEX 100 Standard Company, which basically means that the fabric used for crafting your oversized towels are individually checked and audited to high safety standards for you and your family. With rigorous processing, packaging, and quality-oriented approach we believe in giving only the best, that’s why we also give you a guarantee! SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are so confident in the quality of our oversized bath towels that we offer a satisfaction guarantee! If you are unsatisfied, simply contact us through the seller tab, and within 24 hours we will address your concern. Creosa premium cotton bath towels are great gifts for all occasions including Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, New Years', Birthdays & Anniversaries. It’s the best gift as its premium & comes with minimum maintenance. EASY WASH CARE – Machine wash at 40°C/105°F on gentle cycle & tumble dry low. Bleach or creams containing bleaching agents may cause color loss in washing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3b1QGpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CREOSA","source_asin":"B099JPZB76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099JPZB76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099JPZB76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
