window.products.push({"id":470435,"name":"Clear Table Protector Plastic Waterproof Tablecloth Cover Vinyl Transparent Tablecloths Protector for Dining Room Table Rectangle PVC Lace Oil Proof C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qHUxHHJQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality and Eco-friendly Material: Our Clear Plastic Table Protector Vinyl Tablecloth is made of high quality eco-friendly PVC with Lace is made of 100% polylester. PVC Lace Tablecloth, environmentally friendly, non-toxic, tasteless, renewable materials, 0.3mm thicker, better gloss, more wear-resistant, not easy to tear, not easy to turn yellow. Keep higher transparency than normal other PVC tablecloths in market. Features: Our clear plastic tablecloth protector is 100% waterproof, oil-proof, and Anti-Scratch protection. Our Table Cover is Durable and reusable, which can easily protect your table from scratches, oil stains and other stains. It will save you time to clean your table and always look brand new for your dining table. Easy Care: When the PVC Lace Tablecloth is stained with tea stains, oil stains or others, there is no need to wash it, just wipe it gently with warm water or mild detergent. It’s very easy and convenient to clear this clear table protector. Make your life more convenient, worry-free and comfortable every single day! Care Instructions: Because this plastic table cover is folded for storage and transportation, there may be wrinkles when you open it for the first time, if you leave it alone, which will slowly disappear on its own. You can also wipe with a rag soaked in hot water or iron to remove wrinkles quickly. Due to the material properties, it may have a little deviation, generally, the length and width are ±3cm(1 inch), which is within the normal range. Please carefully consider if you mind that. Multiple Usage Scenarios: Our Plastic PVC Tablecloth is very suitable for many scenes, such as dining room, living room coffee table, wedding, banquet, entertainment, outdoor activities, study reading and drinking coffee. A variety of sizes are available for you to choose from, which will definitely meet your daily needs and make your life more tidy, convenient and free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qHUxHHJQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRJOYNY","source_asin":"B09G14RNM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G14RNM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G14RNM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
