window.products.push({"id":470442,"name":"Can Opener Set Manual - Multifunctional Can Opener 8 in 1, Jar Bottle Opener 4 in 1 and Wine Bottle Opener Waiters Corkscrew, Home Kitchen Tools Kit, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-PfKDTnXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 8 in 1 manual can opener and jar opener is perfect for home, kitchen, go camping, picnic, etc. HOW TO USE 8 IN 1 MANUAL CAN OPENER? 1. Open the handles.2. Turn the handle to adjust the gear and blade to the proper position.3. Latch on to the lip of can and lock it.4. Stay on the can and twist off the can lid, give you a clean, continuous cut like it should.5. Built-in magnet hangs on to the lid after cutting and helps you lift the lid off the can.6. Turn the handle counter clockwise to release the lid. Then just pull the lid off the magnet. Product features: 1. Open beer lid/water bottle cap/can/tin.2. Pry can lid/hood.3. Pull off can’s tab/pop-up ring.4. Cut bag mouth/package.5. Easily lift the lid with a built-in magnet.6. Protective blade cover protect you from hurt.7. Design with 4 different Jar opener gripper and inner rubber will give your hands the power to open any Jar lips just in squeeze.8.Make it comfortable to hold with the smooth wide, easy turning ergonomic handle design.9. Give away a corkscrew wine opener. Product attributes: Product name: 8 In 1 Manual Can Opener and Jar Opener（with A Wine Opener）Material: High hardness ABS material and high carbon alloy stainless steel cutter head(8 in 1 Manual Can Opener)Polypropylene, TPR (Thermo-Plastic-Rubber)(Jar Opener)Size: 7.5 x 2.6 x 2.4 inches (8 in 1 Manual Can Opener)8.8 x 3.5 x 0.8 inches (Jar Opener) Packing list 1 x Can Opener1 x Jar Opener1 x Wine Opener Kindly notes for safety and maintenance： 1.Be careful the sharp blade in case of getting fingers hurt.2.Please place it out of the reach of children.3.Wash it under running water, wipe off the can opener and dry it after cleaning. Store it at dry places. If you have any question about this product, please feel free to contact us, we will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-PfKDTnXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FECILA","source_asin":"B08K8C237M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8C237M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8C237M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
