window.products.push({"id":470557,"name":"Auertech Evaporative Air Cooler, Portable 3 in 1 Swamp Cooling Fan with Ice Crystal Boxes, Water Tank and Casters, 3-Mode 3-Speed Air Cooler for Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512LgiFRbYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features: Better Air Cooling Easy and safety to use Visible Water Tank & Filter Easy to move Specifications: Product size: 14.5\" x 12\" x 29\" inches Net weight: 11lbs Wattage: 125W Voltage: 110V/60Hz Water Tank Capacity: 3.8 gallons Fan speed: 1350 RPM Wind Mode: Normal/Cooling/Swing Package includes: 1 x air cooler , 4 x ice crystal box, 1 X Manual Description: No more hot sweaty summer but a super cool one! Equipped with a large water tank, it can run continuously for a longer time than other coolers and you don’t need to add water again and again. With 4 ice crystal boxes, it can further enhance cooling performance. Our indoor swamp cooler has three wind speed settings (Low/Mid/High) and three modes(Normal/Cooling/Swing) for you to choose. In addition, the built-in air filter can further filter out dust and improve the air quality. Our evaporative cooler can provide clean air and help you stay cool at the same time. 4 rolling wheels at the bottom makes our air cooler easy to move around. This compact evaporative cooler is pretty space-saving. While we don’t sacrifice the cooling function, the window for louver fan is still big enough so that it still can blow out much cool air. This cooler can be used as a personal fan, humidifier and purifier. Enjoy this hot summer! How to use it: 1. Put the frozen ice box into the water tank and add water into the tank. 2. Plug in and press the ON/OFF button to start the air cooling fan. 3. Set the comfortable wind speed. 4. Keep replacing frozen ice boxes to get cold air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512LgiFRbYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auertech","source_asin":"B09X5H6BL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X5H6BL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X5H6BL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
