window.products.push({"id":470567,"name":"Stainless Steel Hair Dryer Holder, Wall Mount 3M Adhesive Blow Dryer Rack Storage Organizer with Plug Stand for Bathroom, Bedroom, Barber Shop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N316b1JGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shinning Go Hair Dryer Holder Specifications: Finish: Brushed finish Material: SUS304 Stainless Steel Installation: By self-adhesive or Punching (use screws) Sticking Side Dimension: about 3.86*1.97 inch (9.8*5 cm) Holder Diameter: about 2.95 inch (7.5cm) Installation (3M adhesive method): 1. Clean the surface of the tilt wall/ glass to ensure there is no dust, oil or grease until it is dry. 2. Tear off the 3M adhesive behind the holder, and press it against the surface about 30 seconds or more. 3. Wait for 24-48 hours, then you are free to hang your hair dryer on the holder ( This is important, please do not hang anything at least for 24 hours). Note: As the 3M adhesive is very strong, it may be hard to remove the hook once it is glued, please make sure where you would like to use it before installation. Leave the holder at least 24 hours if you use the adhesive method. Please don't stick it on the surface of Painted Wall / Lime Wall / Paper Wall / Uneven Wall / Fabric / Leather, etc. Package: 1 x hair dryer holder (installation accessories included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N316b1JGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shinning Go","source_asin":"B077GNXYPZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GNXYPZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GNXYPZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
