window.products.push({"id":470629,"name":"Osaka, Glass Coffee Dripper - Diamond Weave Dripper with Removeable Stainless Steel Base For Pour Over Coffee Kenroku-en","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d-SCaT5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get the perfect brew with Osaka .Brewing coffee is an art form, and it can be pretty challenging. We at Osaka would like to help you up, your coffee game. If you follow our instructions and tips, and with some practice, you should be brewing the perfect cup of coffee in no time. Impress yourself and your guests with an awesome tasting coffee every time. Kenroku-en is our Glass Coffee Dripper. Diamond Weave Design The uniquely engineered diamond shape creates cross-flow channels for even distribution and prevents clogging. This results in optimal extraction and astounding flavors. Stainless Steel Base The stylish base allows you to use the dripper on any mug, thermos or carafe so you can enjoy the best tasting coffee the way you like it. It can be disassembled easily for storage or cleaning. 10 Paper Filters Included Each filter is made of chlorine free natural paper. The micro-fine holes do not allow any sediments to pass,delivering a fresher, better tasting coffee. “Osaka” what does it mean?Osaka, is a large city on the Japanese island of Honshu, and is known for its modern architecture, boisterous nightlife and delicious coffee shops. We were inspired by their coffee brewing techniques, and from that “Osaka Coffee” was born. Every one of our products will look good enough to display and will perform better than anything else. If you are not yet in love with the process of coffee-making, be prepared to be infatuated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d-SCaT5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osaka","source_asin":"B06XXMSX72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XXMSX72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XXMSX72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
