window.products.push({"id":470735,"name":"JONYJ Drawer Dividers Organizers 8 Pack, Adjustable Separators 3.2\" High Expandable from 11\"-19\", Clear Plastic Drawer Organizers for Clothing, Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yX9N4qFyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acrylic ☀【Expandable & Adjustable】The adjustable length drawer divider 3.2 inches high and 11-19 inches long. They are easily adjustable and can be stretched or shortened with a simple pull, and stay in place once secured. Helps you quickly turn a messy, empty dresser drawer into a pleasing, organized divider drawer. Besides, before you buy a drawer organizer, measure the size of your drawers to make sure you get a space that fits and holds the items you want to accommodate. 🌻【Perfect Design】 The thickness of this drawer divider is carefully designed to be just 0.6 inches, which is sturdy and stable while not taking up drawer space. The stylish yet practical design maximizes space and organizes your items perfectly. All you need to do is put them where you want them and let them bring the perfect effect to your drawers. 🌴【Quality Material】 This drawer divider is made of high quality shatterproof plastic, anti-slip and anti-scratch. Strong and durable while protecting your furniture from rub marks and unsightly scratches. In addition, the drawer divider is clear and features a simple, modern design with good-looking style. Fits perfectly with any drawer you have. 🌲【Easy To Install】 Our drawer dividers are quicker and easier to install than most drawer dividers with latches or built-in springs. You just need to stick double-sided tape on both sides of the c dividers, put them in the drawer and adjust them to the right position.These drawer dividers can be firmly fixed in the drawer, not easy to slide, easy to organize, give all of your belongings a suitable home. ⭐ 【Multipurpose Drawer Organizer】 The Drawer divider can be used in any scene of drawers. You can use the drawer organizer to organize items such as cutlery, silverware, utensils in the kitchen; toiletries in the bathroom; cosmetics on the dresser in the bedroom; or small stationery items in the office, etc.It will keep your drawers organized and tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yX9N4qFyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONYJ","source_asin":"B0BRV32H8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRV32H8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRV32H8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":470736,"name":"Estilo Professional Grade 48 Blade Meat Tenderizer, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6175njh59OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Estilo meat tenderizer has 48 stainless steel razor sharp blades that penetrate any cut of meat with ease and makes the toughest cut of meat into a juicy, flavorful, masterpiece. It tenderizes meat, poultry or fish prior to marinating, which allows spices and flavor to be absorbed quickly and deeply. Tenderizes the meat without changing the flavor. This kitchen gadget is the high-end restaurant's best kept secret for achieving their zestful and savory results. For best results run the tenderizer over the meat in multiple patterns vertical, horizontal, diagonal to the right and left; then flip over the meat over and do the same for the other side. Easy to clean; wash with soap and warm water. Tenderizer is top-rack dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6175njh59OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Estilo","source_asin":"B00YSOXMFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YSOXMFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YSOXMFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
