window.products.push({"id":470801,"name":"8 oz Upgraded Plastic Jars with Lids 20 Pack, Airtight Plastic Slime Containers for Kitchen & Household Food Storage of Dry Goods, Cosmetic, body butt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FbxbTGM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package Includes】The package includes 20 pack 8 oz-upgraded version clear plastic slime jars with airtight lids. The full capacity can hold 10 oz. Each plastic container is packed in a separate bag and then packed into a carton. Single Product Mouth diameter:2.75 inches; Height: 3.34 inches; Bottom diameter: 2.83 inches. 【Premium PET Material】Thickened plastic jars are more heavy-duty and stronger than ordinary plastic jars, each jars weighs 1.41 ounces. These round plastic jars are made of premium food-grade plastic, which is safe, durable and impact resistant. BPA free, don't worry that harmful toxins will penetrate into food or body lotion after multiple uses. 【Leak-proof and tight seal】The screw-in transparent top cover forms an airtight seal to keep the food in the container clean and fresh, and keep the mucus or putty moist. 【wide-mouth jars design】Plastic slime containers jars with wide mouth allows for easy filling and refillable. Cleaning is simple as well. Hand wash suggested (Do NOT put in dishwasher and microwave ). 【Versatile Use】Use these storage jars with lids in the kitchen, pantry or household to store dry foods, Peanut Butter, party supplies and other small parts or crafts. They can also be filled with homemade essential oil mixtures and used as body lotions, moisturizers or specimen collection containers. 20pcs small plastic jars are versatile and easy to carry. Apart from using them for different purposes, they can be shared with friends or as gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FbxbTGM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bokzen","source_asin":"B08V1Q5F4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V1Q5F4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V1Q5F4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":470802,"name":"Moroccan Cooking Tagine Handmade 100% Lead Free Safe Large 12 inches Across Traditional","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613209VMqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple and functional, this authentic, handcrafted Moroccan cooking Tagine is ready to be used for your next flavorful and exotic Moroccan meal.The Tagine is to be use on the top of electrical or glass stove or inside the stove. If you have a gas stove with flames please use a protective metal piece to protect your Tagine from cracking. HOW TO CURE A TAGINE? It is necessary that it is seasoned before initial use. Please follow these simple instructions below for maximum results: 1. WATER: The new tagine needs to be first submerged in water for at least 1 hour. If you can’t submerge it, place it in a clean sink bowl and slowly fill the base of the tagine with water until it stops absorbing it. Place the tagine lid on top and fill it as well. Let stand for 30 minutes to allow full absorption of water into the clay. Empty excess water and set to dry for 5 minutes. 2. OLIVE OIL: All you need is 3 table spoons of olive oil, 2 for the base and one for the lid. Spread the olive oil throughout the base and lid with your hand. 3: HEAT: While the tagine is still wet with the oil applied to it, place it in the oven as shown in the first or second photos, and set temperature at 350 F and leave for 45 minutes. The evaporation of moisture creates a vacuum effect to pull the olive oil into the clay which glazes and seals it. Then leave the tagine cool down in the turned off oven.TAGINE MUST BE COOKED IN LOW TEMPERATURES AND A DIFFUSER IS RECOMMANDED TO AVOID BREAKAGE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613209VMqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Treasures of Morocco","source_asin":"B07F96F4YM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F96F4YM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F96F4YM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
