window.products.push({"id":470824,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies Dream Collection Partridge in a Pear Tree Figurine, 5.9 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619n+c0NPUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the traditional Christmas carol, this snow baby sings to the partridge nestled in the pear tree. Glittered accents and the snow baby's hand-knit scarf complete the scene. Designed by artist Kristi Jensen Pierre and manufactured exclusively for department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619n+c0NPUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00KCDR6A2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KCDR6A2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KCDR6A2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
