window.products.push({"id":470826,"name":"GFCC 54x54'' Royal Blue & White Checkered Tablecloth Checker Table Cloth Square Washable Polyester Table Cover Wedding Party Birthday Buffet Table Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-IJlewO7L._AC_SL1410_.jpg","description":"Welcome to GFCC!!! GFCC polyester tablecloth features a seamless design making it ideal for use at any wedding venue. Tablecloth is available in a wide array of colors designed to complement nearly any color scheme. Our tablecloths are made of woven polyester and are designed to be durable, wrinkle and stain resistant, and can be laundered countless times. These tablecloths are not only affordable but uniquely designed. Machine washable for many cycles and stain resistant, they are perfect for every celebration imaginable ranging from weddings, children and birthday parties, to graduation and especially banquets, even corporate and entertainment events. For proper care: Our polyester material needs to be washed in cold water with normal detergent. Stain remover is OK if necessary, bleach is OK for whites. Bespoke: GFCC main products are polyester tablecloths, stretch tablecloths, spandex chair covers ,spandex chair sashes,sequin tablecloths,sequin tablerunners,sequin backdrops,burlap lace table runners. We also offer a bespoke service, so if you cannot find the size or colour you need then please contact us with your requirements. Information: Size:54x54 inch Square Size:54x54 inch Square Color:Royal Blue and White Checkered Color:Royal Blue and White Checkered Material: 100% Polyester with stain and wrinkle resistant. Material: 100% Polyester with stain and wrinkle resistant. Package included: 1 x tablecloth with seamless design. Package included: 1 x tablecloth with seamless design. Edges are folded and then hemmed. Edges are folded and then hemmed. Shipping from Amazon:Normally,it would take about 1-4 days for shipping. Stander shipping: China Post, would spend about 10-15 days for shipping. Expedite shipping: DHL, would spend about 2-5 days for shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-IJlewO7L._AC_SL1410_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFCC","source_asin":"B074TFJW2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074TFJW2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074TFJW2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":470827,"name":"NOVICA Floral Large Suar Wood Relief Panel, Brown, Herons in A Lotus Pond'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TMOn5AgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Herons fish in the shallow waters of a lotus pond. Detailing their sleek plumage, Eka presents a splendidly carved relief sculpture for wall display.  - Signed by the artist - Wood grain and color can vary slightly - Intended as wall decor   About our Artist: I am Eka, and I was introduced to Novica by my husband Putra Suteja. Unfortunately he passed away in 2009 after a long illness, leaving me with a 3 year old daughter and a 10 day old son. I decided to honor his memory by continuing carving, something I learnt from my father from a very young age. Dad would carve and my mother, brothers and I would finish the pieces. We worked this way until I married Putra Suteja.  He liked to carve coconut shells and we enjoyed developing new styles and designs together, then I would make the samples. Now that I'm the sole provider for my children, I continue to carve coconut shells, and I also carve statuettes from wood.  My children are my biggest motivation to work and to move on. Even though now I am alone, I always keep my spirit up and go on strong for my children. Thanks to them I do not falter, and thanks to all of you for always supporting me.  Being associated with Novica means I can feed my children – I will always do my best to provide a good future for them. Thanks Novica and thanks to you all, because you encourage me to continue developing new ideas and designs for the sculptures so they will be always liked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TMOn5AgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00G4R68PO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G4R68PO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G4R68PO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
