window.products.push({"id":470829,"name":"Pipishell Bamboo Cutting Board Set of 3 - Wood Cutting Board for Kitchen Chopping - for Meat, Cheese, and Vegetables - Butcher Block Serving Tray, PIB","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NBuNK0F4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whole Bamboo Block: The whole bamboo process not only makes this cutting board set more smooth and beautiful, but also not easy to crack like other cutting boards made of bamboo strips, and there will be no food residue stuck in the gaps of the cutting board, which is durable and clean. Different Sizes for Different Needs: Our bamboo cutting board set consists of 3 different sizes including small (9” x 6”), medium (12” x 8”), and large (15” x 10”), perfect or multi-course meals. Use the large for pizza or turkey, medium for cheese and bread, or small for fruit and vegetables. Premium Bamboo Wood: Bamboo is one of the fastest-growing plants on the planet. Our bamboo cutting boards are made of 100% bamboo to be extremely strong—harder than other woods—while also being easier on your knives when compared to plastic or glass. Easy Cleaning & Maintenance: The bamboo cutting board is dense enough so that food does not penetrate very deep. Easily clean the bamboo cutting board with soap and water while remembering to apply food-grade oil consistently to maintain the bamboo. A Perfect Gift: This bamboo cutting board set makes a lovely gift for friends and family who love to cook and entertain. A dependable wood cutting board is essential for parties, family dinners, or even snack time if you need a cheese platter or appetizer tray.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NBuNK0F4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pipishell","source_asin":"B0B1792LFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1792LFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1792LFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
