window.products.push({"id":470916,"name":"Duvet Cover Set Twin Size - Black & White Buffalo Plaid 2 Piece Bedding Sets (1 Comforter Cover + 1 Pillow Sham) - Luxury Soft Microfiber Quilt Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-pf18vecS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✔【SOFT DUVET COVER】-- Twin duvet cover set made by 100% premium quality double brushed lightweight microfiber, skin-friendly, cooling, breathable, machine washable and never fade, ensures an ultra-soft and comfortable experience. Keeps your body fresh to give a slumber all night long. ✔【DELICATE DETAILS】-- Checked duvet cover with zipper closure, Easy for you to put your comforter in or out. 4 corner ties inside is convenient to keep your duvet non-slip, ensuring greater comfort at night. Seal off your luxury quilt, comforter or duvet quicker and easier than regular button closure to speed up your bed making process. ✔【EASY CARE】-- Refresh your room easily as a removable protective layer to embrace your duvet or comforter - Easier to wash and switch than your bulky comforters. Please kindly make sure the zipper is fully closed when washing the duvet cover twin. machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. ✔【BUFFALO PLAID BEDDING】-- An twin size gingham is a statement look, and this buffalo check bedding makes for a casual, comfortable choice. This duvet cover pairs perfectly with the matching shams, or you can mix with solids and a plethora of patterns to create a look all your own. ✔【BLACK AND WHITE BEDDING】-- 1 twin duvet cover 68\"x 90\", 1 standard size pillow sham 20\" x 36\" - Please kindly note this is a duvet cover that doesn't include the insert and comforter. NOKOLULU offers return and exchange within 30 days of purchase, please no hesitate to reach us if there is any question, we are glad to hear your voice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-pf18vecS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOKOLULU","source_asin":"B07FRYVHQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FRYVHQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FRYVHQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":470917,"name":"Fabrics and Drapes 48 Inch (4 Foot) - 4 Pack - Free Priority Shipping - Amazing Drapery Fluted Clear Acrylic Curtain Wands 1/2 Inch Thick with Snap Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bt-PTWOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your draperies clean and free from fingerprints with this high quality acrylic fluted drapery wand. High quality stainless steel curtain hooks make your life better. Our snap curtain hooks are made of stainless steel that are durable and sturdy. This hook can be inserted onto the loop of a ring or the actual ring itself. The hook is 1 inch in length and 3/8 inch in width at the widest point. The stainless steel curtain clip hook attaches to the D ring. Our fluted wands are designed very well with a strong stainless D ring attached to the fluted wand. The D ring is 3/4 inches long and 5/8 inches wide. The D ring that attaches to the acrylic fluted rod is very secure and practical. The total size of the clip/snap hook and the D ring is 1 3/4 inches in length total. It is designed with a unique shape that offers great support and movement for the wand as you move it back and forth. The total weight of each individual wand is 5.6 oz. The universal fluted acrylic baton is not only beautiful but sturdy. This curtain wand will protect your drapes. There is no need to touch your drapes so that your white, silk, or sheer curtains won't rip, tear, or get dirty. Your fabric will last longer. This wand is perfect for drapes that are lined and unlined since it is transparent.PROBABLE BENDING ON HEAVIER DRAPES. Works best with lighter drapes. It is 48 inches long to help with easy movements and half inch in width for easy grip. The Lucite fluted wands are available in 36 inches, 48 inches, 60 inches, and 72 inches in length. Measure the length from your curtain rings to where your hand would hold the wand to decide the length needed. This listing is for 4 decorative fluted wands. Please note the hook is tight so it holds well on the loop of the ring or the ring itself. You may need to use pliers to open the hook and attach it to the ring. Do not hook on fabric itself. Does not hook onto drapes with grommets sewn in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bt-PTWOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IF&D","source_asin":"B08FM3KQM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FM3KQM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FM3KQM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
