window.products.push({"id":470939,"name":"Style Setter Patchwork Beverage Dispenser Cold Drink Dispenser w/ 2.4-Gallon Capacity Glass Jug, Ice Insert, Fruit Infuser, Galvanized Base, Leak Proo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jXPxVwdNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don’t just serve—display! Whether you’re serving homemade iced tea, fresh-squeezed lemonade, refreshing spa water, bride and groom’s signature drink, or a crazy mixed concoction, this Beverage Dispenser from Style Setter is the life of the party! Accommodating a 2.4 gallon of any cold drink, the pitcher rests on a table or flat surface for guests’ pouring convenience. Just place a glass under the leak-proof acrylic spigot, fill up with your favorite beverage, and behold the dispenser’s elegant country style. Chic accents include a chrome tap and thick crystalline glass body that shimmers and shines in the sunlight. Remove the airtight lid, easily pour in your ingredients, and create a practical (and pretty!) centerpiece in a matter of seconds. Your treasure making it the perfect present for a wedding, birthday, engagement, anniversary and beyond. No more mixing and pouring glass after glass! Entertain your guests with ease, and add a Beverage Dispenser from Style Setter to your cart today!What You Get 1 x Beverage Dispenser from Style Setter 1 x durable packing A versatile vessel for all your cold concoctions! Specs & Details Body: crystalline glassDimensions: 12\"X12\"X19\" Capacity: 2.4 Gallon Base: Galvanized Base Lead-free Hand-wash only; do not place in dishwasher How to Enjoy Remove the Metal lid and pour ingredients into the wide opening Fill the dispenser with fresh herbs and fruit slices for a pretty aesthetic Place one at the center of your buffet table for a stunning centerpiece Bring instant décor to your next birthday, shower or engagement party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jXPxVwdNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Style Setter","source_asin":"B0C65MYCD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-470939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65MYCD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65MYCD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
